  "title": "Kimchi Jun (Kimchi Pancake) and Dipping Sauce",
  "description": "Korean-style spicy pancakes made of kimchi in an egg and flour batter, served with a snappy dipping sauce, are great for using overly-fermented kimchi.",
  "authors": [
